{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpistrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Execute SQL steps",
                  "field": "execute_sql_steps",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "ODBC / ESS sources",
                  "field": "ess_sources",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "fmxdbc grants",
                  "field": "fmxdbc_grants",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Files with SQL",
                  "field": "files_with_sql",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "findings",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Execute SQL steps",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "findings"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "findings_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "step_uuid",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "pageParam": "page",
              "searchParam": "q",
              "sortParam": "sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "carrier",
                  "label": "Script"
                },
                {
                  "field": "detail",
                  "label": "Step"
                },
                {
                  "field": "sql_preview",
                  "label": "SQL (preview)"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "step_index",
                  "label": "#",
                  "align": "right"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "Script",
                  "file": "{{file}}",
                  "params": {
                    "step": "{{step_uuid}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "ess_sources",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "ODBC / ESS data sources"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "ess_sources"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "ess_sources_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "sample_to_uuid",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "emptyMessage": "No ODBC / ESS sources — all external sources are FileMaker.",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "source_name",
                  "label": "Source"
                },
                {
                  "field": "source_type",
                  "label": "Type",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "to_count",
                  "label": "TOs",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file",
                  "label": "File"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{sample_to_uuid}}",
                  "type": "TableOccurrence"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "grants",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "ODBC / xDBC grants (fmxdbc)",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "grants"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "grants_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "nav_uuid",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "pageParam": "grants_page",
              "searchParam": "grants_q",
              "sortParam": "grants_sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "emptyMessage": "No privilege set grants fmxdbc.",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "extended_privilege",
                  "label": "Extended privilege",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "privilege_set",
                  "label": "Privilege set"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file",
                  "label": "File"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "PrivilegeSet",
                  "file": "{{file}}"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Markdown",
        "id": "markdown",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "content": "## Notes\n\nExternal **SQL** data access. *Execute SQL* is Step_ID-gated (117, locale-independent — in this corpus it is exported as `SQL ausführen`). ODBC / ESS sources are the non-FileMaker entries of the external-data-source catalog; `fmxdbc` grants show which privilege sets allow ODBC/JDBC access.\n\n- This is a **generic template**: the corpus currently has no ODBC/ESS sources (all external sources are FileMaker) and one Execute SQL step — the dashboard stays useful as a reusable library entry.\n- **Navigation**: clicking an Execute SQL step opens the script at the step; an ODBC/ESS source opens its first table occurrence; a grant opens the privilege set.\n- **Related rules**: derived severity rules live under *Static Code Analysis*.\n- **Sorting**: all column headings are clickable (▲▼)."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
